Package: grfics-simulation
Version: 1.3
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Fortiphyd Logic <info@fortiphyd.com>
Description: GRFICSv3 OT lab process simulation
 Tennessee Eastman chemical process simulation with Modbus TCP device
 drivers and a Unity WebGL dashboard. Part of the GRFICSv3 OT/ICS
 security lab VM deployment.
Depends: python3, python3-pip, python-is-python3, nginx, php-fpm,
 iproute2, procps, curl, libjsoncpp25, liblapacke
